OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Frain will spread east across much of
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland and Scotland.
OL,8,FElsewhere it stays dry, with the
OL,9,Fclearest skies in the south. A chilly
OL,10,Fnight follows, with a risk of rural
OL,11,Fgrass frost and isolated shallow fog
OL,12,Fpatches.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FLargely cloudy skies across
OL,15,Fthe north with some outbreaks of light
OL,16,Frain at times. Brighter in the south
OL,17,Fand feeling warm in the sunny spells.
